---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import { park } from '../data/park';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park Islamabad Location & Map"
  description="Lake View Park Islamabad location on Murree Road with Plus Code, Google Maps link and directions. Coordinates and address for planning your visit."
  path="/location-map/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Where exactly is Lake View Park?', a: 'It sits on Murree Road in Islamabad, Pakistan, on the shore of Rawal Lake. The listing address uses the Plus Code P47J+39P, Murree Road, Lake View Park, Islamabad 49510.' },
    { q: 'What are the coordinates?', a: 'Approximately 33.71494, 73.13281. These are for planning and sharing a pin; follow on-site signs for the currently open gate.' },
    { q: 'Which gate should I use?', a: 'The park has more than one access point. Confirm the open gate and lawful drop-off with on-site management, especially on busy weekends and public holidays.' },
    { q: 'How do I navigate there without a street number?', a: 'Paste the Plus Code P47J+39P into Google Maps or most map apps — it resolves to the park without needing a street number.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Location & map', href: '/location-map/' }]}
  image="/images/lake-view-park-rawal-lake.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'How to get there', href: '/how-to-get-there/' },
    { label: 'Parking', href: '/parking/' },
    { label: 'From central Islamabad', href: '/from-islamabad-city/' },
    { label: 'Opening hours', href: '/opening-hours/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Lake View Park sits on <strong>Murree Road</strong> in Islamabad, Pakistan, on the shore of Rawal Lake. The listing address and a navigable map are below.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Address and Plus Code</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8"><b>Listing address:</b> {park.plusCode}, {park.street}, Lake View Park, {park.city} {park.postalCode}, {park.country}.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-8">The <strong>Plus Code {park.plusCode}</strong> works in Google Maps and most map apps — paste it as the destination to reach the park without guessing a street number.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Coordinates</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Approximately <b>{park.lat}, {park.lng}</b>. These are for planning and sharing a pin; follow on-site signs for the currently open gate.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Map and directions</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Open the listing directly: <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href={park.mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Maps ↗</a>. For route options by car, taxi, public transport and from nearby cities, see <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/how-to-get-there/">how to get there</a>.</p>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] card-shadow">
        <iframe title="Lake View Park location map" class="h-[420px] w-full border-0" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" src={park.mapsEmbed}></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">Which gate?</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">The park has more than one access point. Confirm the open gate and lawful drop-off with on-site management, especially on busy weekends and public holidays.</p>
    </div>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Getting oriented</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Murree Road is a major Islamabad artery running along the foothills toward the Margalla Hills and Murree. Rawal Lake is the reservoir that supplies much of the city’s water, and the park sits on its shore. Knowing that the park is lakeside — not deep in a sector block — helps you plan a route that ends at the water rather than circling residential streets.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Save the Plus Code P47J+39P as your navigation destination.',
      'Confirm the open gate and drop-off point with on-site management.',
      'For driving, note that parking access is separately managed — see the parking page.',
      'If using public transport, plan the last leg (taxi or ride-hail) to the gate, since stops may not be at the entrance.',
      'Check the route from your starting point on the how-to-get-there page.',
    ]} />

  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
